/* Settings toggle that saves unpinned clipboard history, encrypted, so it is there after a restart. */
"Keep Clipboard Across Restarts" = "Keep Clipboard Across Restarts";

/* Footer under Keep Clipboard Across Restarts: what is saved, what is never saved, and that turning it off deletes the history. */
"Saves your unpinned clipboard history, encrypted with a key kept in your Keychain, so it is there after you restart. Pinned items are saved either way. Copies from password managers and copies marked private are never saved. Images over 5 MB are never saved, to keep the file small. Turning this off deletes the saved history." = "Saves your unpinned clipboard history, encrypted with a key kept in your Keychain, so it is there after you restart. Pinned items are saved either way. Copies from password managers and copies marked private are never saved. Images over 5 MB are never saved, to keep the file small. Turning this off deletes the saved history.";

